{"root":"berkah","ipa":"/ˈbər.kah/","core":"祝福、恩典、福气，常指来自神明或长辈的赐福与庇佑。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","教会","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈbər.kah/","zh":"祝福、恩典","phrases":[{"t":"mendapat berkah","zh":"得到祝福"},{"t":"bawa berkah","zh":"带来福气"},{"t":"mencari berkah","zh":"寻求恩典"}],"examples":[{"t":"Kehadiran anak ini membawa berkah bagi keluarga kami.","zh":"这个孩子的到来给我们家带来了福气。"},{"t":"Kita harus bersyukur atas segala berkah yang telah diberikan.","zh":"我们应当为所赐予的一切恩典感恩。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"berkah","ipa":"/ˈbər.kah/","zh":"祝福、恩典","phrase":{"t":"berkah Tuhan","zh":"上帝的恩典"},"example":{"t":"Semoga hidupmu selalu dilimpahi berkah.","zh":"愿你的生活总是充满祝福。"}},{"w":"berberkah","ipa":"/bərˈbər.kah/","zh":"有福的、带福气的","phrase":{"t":"hidup berberkah","zh":"有福的生活"},"example":{"t":"Mereka menjalani hari-hari yang berberkah.","zh":"他们过着充满福气的生活。"}},{"w":"memberkahi","ipa":"/məm.bərˈka.hi/","zh":"祝福、赐福于","phrase":{"t":"memberkahi umat","zh":"祝福众人"},"example":{"t":"Pendeta memberkahi jemaat yang hadir.","zh":"牧师祝福了在场的会众。"}},{"w":"memberkati","ipa":"/məm.bərˈka.ti/","zh":"祝福（同 memberkahi）","phrase":{"t":"Tuhan memberkati","zh":"上帝祝福"},"example":{"t":"Semoga Tuhan memberkati keluarga Anda.","zh":"愿上帝祝福您的家庭。"}},{"w":"keberkahan","ipa":"/kə.bərˈka.han/","zh":"福泽、恩泽、吉祥","phrase":{"t":"mencari keberkahan","zh":"寻求福泽"},"example":{"t":"Bulan suci ini penuh dengan keberkahan.","zh":"这个神圣的月份充满了恩泽。"}},{"w":"diberkahi","ipa":"/di.bərˈka.hi/","zh":"被祝福的、蒙福的","phrase":{"t":"diberkahi anak","zh":"赐予孩子（蒙福得子）"},"example":{"t":"Pasangan itu diberkahi seorang anak.","zh":"那对夫妇蒙福得了一个孩子。"}},{"w":"diberkati","ipa":"/di.bərˈka.ti/","zh":"被祝福的（同 diberkahi）","phrase":{"t":"hidup diberkati","zh":"蒙福的生活"},"example":{"t":"Kita adalah orang-orang yang diberkati.","zh":"我们是蒙福的人。"}}],"derSlugs":["berkah","berberkah","memberkahi","memberkati","keberkahan","diberkahi","diberkati"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T10:06:13.841Z","src":"base"}